# Skye Boat Song: Sir Harold Boulton's words (Songs of the North, 1884), not later
# film or TV lyrics. Count 6/8 as two beats: "1 2 3 4 5 6".
{title: Skye Boat Song}
{composer: Anne Campbell MacLeod (tune), Sir Harold Boulton (words)}
{lyricist: Sir Harold Boulton}
{key: G}
{tempo: 96}
{time: 6/8}
{x_level: 2}
{x_strum: D - U D - U}

